      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تأثّر</span></b> <i>It received an impression,</i> or <i>a mark,</i> or
<i>trace; became impressed,</i> or <i>marked.</i> (Msb.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
<i>He,</i> or <i>it, had an impression made,</i> or <i>an effect
produced, upon him,</i> or <i>it; became impressed,
affected,</i> or <i>influenced.</i> (The Lexicons passim.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  See also 8.

